Package: Tumor2Line
Type: Package
Title: Population-Aware Tumor-Cell Line Alignment for Cancer Cell Line Selection
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hua", "Zou", email = "zouhua1@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bin", "Duan", email = "binduan@sjtu.edu.cn", role = c("aut"))
  )
Date: 2026-11-16
Description: Provides a population-aware transcriptomic framework for aligning
    tumor-derived query populations with candidate cancer cell-line populations
    to support cancer cell-line selection. Tumor2Line integrates expression
    harmonization, cohort-specific or external-reference scaled principal
    component representations, and lineage-aware unbalanced optimal transport
    matching. It reports raw transport mass, row-normalized matching weights
    and query-specific candidate rankings. Known query-cell-line pairs are not
    required for matching and, when available, can be used for downstream
    evaluation with Top1 accuracy, Top3 accuracy, mean reciprocal rank and
    true-pair rank.
